# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# Growth OS V3 — Supabase configuration (client-safe public keys only).
# Copy this file to `.env` and fill in your project values, then run the app
# with `npm run dev` (Vite loads .env automatically) or `npm run build`.
#
#   Project URL / keys: Supabase Dashboard → Project Settings → API
#   - URL:       https://<project-ref>.supabase.co
#   - anon key:  the "anon public" key (client-safe by design — it is not a
#                secret; row-level security is what protects user data)
#
# NEVER put the `service_role` key, database passwords or private keys here or
# anywhere in the repo. If these variables are empty/unset the app runs in
# safe LOCAL-ONLY mode (exactly like V2) with no network calls.
# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
VITE_SUPABASE_URL=
VITE_SUPABASE_ANON_KEY=
